      "text": "ArchiMate notation for the 'Realises' relationship: a dotted vertical line ending in a hollow triangular arrowhead. It is the symbol in the 'ArchiMate relationship' column of Table 3.2, 'The relationship types used in the DPI-H reference architecture and what they represent' (section 3.1).",
